; A `;@axiom:` tag belongs to the declaration after it, so one with no
; declaration after it is refused, as the formatter refuses it. It used
; to be dropped with no word, so the claim below applied to nothing
; (tests/fuzz/axtag-trailing.axfuzz). AX2001 at the end of the file.
(:: main Int)
(fn (main)
  0)

;@axiom:restrict(no-alloc)
